From 89fdb9c7d2ad952646dccbd869b4aa2a806b1920 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:11:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] perf(hosted-rooms): memoize positive read-store readiness
 [daveey]

Every hosted-room supervisor polls list_rooms every five seconds. Opening a
fresh connection also repeated every table_info, index and legacy-import
readiness probe, despite no schema changes. Cache only a proven True result
per process, keyed by resolved path, device, inode and schema_version. Keep
access locked and bounded to 128 paths; bracket open with file identity so a
replacement during open cannot inherit its predecessor's memo.

No change to _connect, migrations, write paths, or poll interval. No connection
is retained across cycles: SQLite open/close cost remains.

Proof:
- RED: unchanged-store and post-repair warm-read tests failed on the original;
  dropped-index repair, same-cookie new-inode replacement and never-cache-False
  controls retained.
- GREEN: initial four targeted files passed 59 tests. Extended regression suite
  covers replacement during open, bounded eviction and cross-thread reuse.
- CPU microbenchmark (Linux worker, Python 3.14.9, process_time_ns): seven
  alternating before/after batches of 500 list_rooms calls each, 20 warmups,
  disposable unchanged shared-state.db, asserting room counts each call.
  Baseline is the exact _read_connection from 05ba9149f1f1c063c83123ba675ec4ead1550819;
  all other code and fixture state identical. Median microseconds/call:
  empty store 564.33 -> 364.73 (35.37% lower); ten rooms 627.94 -> 402.35
  (35.93% lower). This is component CPU, not live supervisor CPU acceptance.
  Opening connections still costs CPU. The <=0.7%-of-one-core live budget
  belongs to the originating re-measure card, after normal core update;
  no production gateway was restarted or re-measured here.

Rollback: revert this commit; no schema/config changes.
---
 gateway/hosted_rooms.py                       |  35 ++++-
 .../gateway/test_hosted_rooms_ready_cache.py  | 147 ++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 180 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
